        "milestones": {
            "primary": 7,
            "primaryText": "Saber Savant [265\u2605]\nExpert+ difficulty: Obtain an SS rank on Power of the Saber Blade (PotSB), Tempo Katana and Dragon Smash Goblin (DSG).\n\nI Can See My Rise Up On the Horizon [180\u2605]\nExpert+ difficulty: Obtain an SS rank on every song in base game packs (OSTs, Camellia pack, Extras pack), excluding PotSB, Tempo Katana and DSG.\n\nRock Out With Your Hands Out [65\u2605]\nExpert+ difficulty: Pass the songs PotSB, Tempo Katana and DSG.\n\nI Been Out Here Grinding [75\u2605]\nExpert+ difficulty: Pass every song in base game packs (OSTs, Camellia pack, Extras pack), excluding PotSB, Tempo Katana and DSG.\n\nI Got the Power [70\u2605]\nExpert difficulty or higher: Obtain an SS rank on every song in all base game packs (OSTs, Camellia pack, Extras pack).\n\nI Can Swing for Hours [40\u2605]\nExpert difficulty or higher: Pass every song in all base game packs (OSTs, Camellia pack, Extras pack).\n\nBeat the Beat Up [5\u2605]\nClear all missions in the campaign.",
            "secondary": 4,
            "secondaryText": "Slice Them All! Dice Them All! [0\u2605]\nExpert+ difficulty: Obtain a Full Combo on the songs PotSB, Tempo Katana and DSG.\n\nI'm a Living Legend [0\u2605]\nExpert+ difficulty: Obtain a Full Combo on every song in base game packs (OSTs, Camellia pack, Extras pack), excluding PotSB, Tempo Katana and DSG.\n\nI Got Unlimited Power [15\u2605]\nExpert difficulty or higher: Obtain a Full Combo on every song in all base game packs.\n\nHalf the Arms, Double the Fun [0\u2605]\nComplete all base game songs on One Saber mode on the highest difficulty available (all of OST1 and OST2, and select songs in OST3-5, Extras Pack, Camellia Pack).",
            "community": 3,
            "communityText": "Born to Vaporize Them All\nExpert+ difficulty: Obtain an SS+ rank (95%+) on PotSB, Tempo Katana and DSG.\n\nI Am the Greatest of All Time, Man\nExpert+ difficulty: Obtain an SS+ rank (95%+) on every song in base game packs (OSTs, Camellia pack, Extras pack), excluding PotSB, Tempo Katana and DSG.\n\nI'm a Phenomenon and Carry On\nExpert difficulty or higher: Obtain an SS+ rank (95%+) on every song in all base game packs.",
            "achievements": 26
        },
