            "community": 2,
            "communityText": "A Cut Above\nComplete a 5BC run untouched. (Without taking damage)\n\nDyed Cell\nSeparately, complete 5BC runs with the following Custom Mode presets: I love Brutality, Tactics for the win, Survival is my jam.",
