        "information": "\"The strength of the oak\" achievement is worded ambiguously\u2014the game still awards the achievement to players who use items and blessings as long as they are not health-related:\n\u2022 \"Cursed Vitality\" does not count as a healing blessing and is strongly recommended for the PO.\n\u2022 Unlocking the \"Charging Fury\" skill at the skill tree will allow you to heal off of projectiles during your PO run.\n\nFor the COs:\n\u2022 Assist options should not be used at any point for all COs.\n\u2022 In-game timer must be on for all COs.\n\u2022 Rerolling HP shops and blessings is allowed for the hitless and damageless CO."
