        "information": "This page serves as a list of puzzle games on Steam curated by CE. Each game listed will require you to either complete all/specific achievements in the game, or complete all in-game puzzles offered. The difficulty of these games are ranked on a three-tier system, ranging from Moderate (\ud83d\udfe8), to Challenging (\ud83d\udfe5), to Extreme (\u2b1b). A specialized potentials list for puzzle games can be found on <https://tinyurl.com/PuzzlePotentials>. For more info on how we handle puzzle games, including how they are added to the site, please check the wiki page: <https://wiki.cedb.me/general/details/puzzle-games.html>.\n\nGuidelines for proof submission: Steam profile link for achievements, screenshot/video for everything else.\n\nTo be eligible for these achievements, please add the associated game to your library by pressing the button at the bottom of this column. After that, you can then post your proof. \n\nPlease remember that the objectives on this page do not count toward CO-related roles."
