            "primary": 3,
            "primaryText": "Cloudberry King [100\u2605]\nBeat the normal version of level 320.\n\nApex Masochism [275\u2605]\nBeat the normal version of level 319.\n\nBerry Cloudy with No Chance of Victory [25\u2605]\nReach level 319.",
            "secondary": 8,
            "secondaryText": "Cloudberry Emperor [150\u2605]\nBeat the Anders version of level 320.\n\nApex Psychosis [50\u2605]\nBeat the Anders version of level 319.\n\nMadness? This is Cloudberry Kingdom! [0\u2605]\nReach level 150 in Madness.\n\nThe Hero with a Thousand Faces [5\u2605]\nReach level 150 in both Hero Rush and Hybrid Rush.\n\nEnd-of-Life Crisis [0\u2605]\nReach level 150 with \"Gravity Bob\", \"Flappy Blob\", \"Porkchop Girl\", \"Time Ship\" and \"Masochistic\" in Time Crisis.\n\nLiving On Borrowed Time [15\u2605]\nReach level 150 as all other playstyles in Time Crisis.\n\nDevelopmental Climax [0\u2605]\nReach level 150 with [TBD] in Escalation.\n\nCharacter Growth [0\u2605]\nReach level 150 with all other playstyles in Escalation.",
            "community": 0,
