        "information": "Values for the Anders objectives are valued on the assumption that you have previously cleared the normal version.\n\nTo access and play Anders 319 and 320 without replaying Chapter 7, go to The Arcade -> Free Play -> Load Level and input the following seeds:\n\n\u2022 **Anders 319**: 0;s:115551379;h:2,0,0,0;t:anders__dungeon;n:1;l:15000;u:9,0,0,9,0,9,9,0,0,9,9,8.860097,9,0,0,9,0,9,0,0,0,9,9,9;m:0;masochist;song:Happy^James_Stant;fadein:.01;\n\n\u2022 **Anders 320**: 0;s:119491379;h:0,0,0,0;t:anders__dungeon;n:1;l:15000;u:9,0,0,9,0,9,9,0,0,9,9,8.860097,9,0,0,9,0,9,0,0,0,9,9,9;m:0;masochist;\n\n**To play PC levels on Linux, install .NET and XNA frameworks with Winetricks, then launch the game through Wine:**\n\\> winetricks dotnet40 xna40"
