        "information": "The game is valued assuming you play offline for the final boss. This limits the pool of possible levels to only those included in the installation of the game.\n\nThe curated playlists are not exclusive to the \"Weekly Mix\" tab: they are able to be found through the \"Playlists\" tab and typing in the name in the search bar.\n\nFor \"Fairlight Makers\", the following levels are required for video proof:\n\u2022 \"L Side\"\n\u2022 \"The Greenhouse\"\n\u2022 First screen of level select showing all levels completed (second screen is not required as they are optional bonus level)."
